   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">That should work but make sure the tags$style() and includeScript() calls are <i>part</i> of your actual UI object (i.e. somewhere inside the call to fluidPage(...) or whatever), not just <i>in</i> the ui.R file.</div><br><div class=\"gmail_quote\"></div>"
    ],
