 style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">getElementById</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;antiClickjack&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>antiClickjack</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">parentNode</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">removeChild</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">antiClickjack</span><span style=\"color:#660\">);</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">else</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">{</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>top</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">location </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#008\">self</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">location</span><span style=\"color:#660\">;</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br></span><span style=\"color:#660\">}</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br><br></span></div></code></div><div><br>Don&#39;t really understand all of the code, so any help would be welcome.</div></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p></blockquote></div>"
