     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>I have been trying to find a solution for clickjacking since a week and am still struggling,</div><div>Can you please share the working code ?</div><div><br></div><div>Appreciate your help.</div><div><br></div><div>Regards,</div><div>Jiger</div></div>"
